e are {n} examples of {src_lang} audio with their {tgt_lang} translations and one-sentence\n3986\tsummaries.\n3987\tFollowing these examples, listen to the last audio and produce:\n3988\t- \"Translation\": <tgt_lang translation>\n3989\t- \"Summary\": <one-sentence tgt_lang summary>\n3990\tOutput ONLY these two lines, with no additional text or formatting.\n3991\t\n3992\tFigure 11: Prompt for Gemini3.1-Pro few-shot (FS) setting in the translation→summarization direction.\n3993\tGemini3.1-Pro FS Summarization→Translation\n3994\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer.\n3995\tHere are {n} examples of {src_lang} audio with their {tgt_lang} one-sentence summaries.\n3996\tFollowing these examples, listen to the last audio and produce:\n3997\t- \"src_lang Summary\": <one-sentence src_lang summary>\n3998\t- \"Translation\": <one-sentence tgt_lang translation of the summary>\n3999\tOutput ONLY these two lines, with no additional text or formatting.\n4000\t\n4001\tFigure 12: Prompt for Gemini3.1-Pro few-shot (FS) setting in the summarization→translation direction.\n4002\tGemini3.1-Pro ZS Translation→Summarization\n4003\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer.\n4004\tListen to the following {src_lang} audio and produce:\n4005\t- \"Translation\": <tgt_lang translation>\n4006\t- \"Summary\": <one-sentence tgt_lang summary>\n4007\tOutput ONLY these two lines, with no additional text or formatting.\n4008\t\n4009\tFigure 13: Prompt for Gemini3.1-Pro zero-shot (ZS) setting in the translation→summarization direction.\n4010\tGemini3.1-Pro ZS Summarization→Translation\n4011\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer.\n4012\tFirst summarize the audio in one sentence, then translate it.\n4013\tListen to the following {src_lang} audio and produce:\n4014\t- \"One-sentence src_lang Summary\": <one-sentence src_lang summary>\n4015\t- \"Translation\": <tgt_lang translation of the one-sentence summary>\n4016\tOutput ONLY these two lines, with no additional text or formatting.\n4017\t\n4018\tFigure 14: Prompt for Gemini3.1-Pro zero-shot (ZS) setting in the summarization→translation direction.\n4019\tGemini3.1-Pro Cascaded Summarization\n4020\tYou are a professional summarizer.\n4021\tBelow is an automatic speech recognition (ASR) transcription of {src_lang} audio;\n4022\tit may contain transcription errors and disfluencies. \"\n4023\tSummarize its entirety in {src_lang} in a concise, comprehensive one-sentence summary.\n4024\tOutput ONLY the summary, with no additional text or formatting.\n4025\t\n4026\tFigure 15: Prompt for Gemini3.1-Pro few-shot (FS) setting in the translation→summarization direction.\n4027\t\n4028\t\fGemini3.1-Pro Cascaded Translation\n4029\tYou are a professional translator.\n4030\tBelow is an automatic speech recognition (ASR) transcription of {src_lang} audio;\n4031\tit may contain transcription errors and disfluencies.\n4032\tTranslate it into {tgt_lang}.\n4033\tOutput ONLY the translation, with no additional text or formatting.\n4034\t\n4035\tFigure 16: Prompt for Gemini3.1-Pro few-shot (FS) setting in the translation→summarization direction.\n4036\t\n4037\t\fGemma4-12B FS Translation→Summarization\n4038\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer.\n4039\tYou are given 5 examples of {src_lang} audio and their corresponding\n4040\tsummaries in {tgt_lang}.\n4041\tYou will hear {src_lang} audio. You must translate everything said into {tgt_lang} and also provide\n4042\ta single-sentence summary of the main point.\n4043\tYour response MUST contain exactly two lines:\n4044\t- \"Line 1\": Translation: <complete tgt_lang translation of everything said in the audio>\n4045\t- \"Line 2\": Summary: <single sentence in tgt_lang summarising the main point>\n4046\tDo not add any other text, explanation, or formatting.\n4047\tBoth lines are required.\n4048\t\n4049\tFigure 17: Prompt for Gemma4-12B few-shot (FS) setting in the translation→summarization direction.\n4050\tGemma4-12B FS Summarization→Translation\n4051\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer.\n4052\tYou are given 5 examples of {src_lang} audio and their corresponding summaries in {tgt_lang}.\n4053\tYou will hear {src_lang} audio. You must summarize the audio into a single sentence in {src_lang} and\n4054\ttranslate the summary to {tgt_lang}.\n4055\tYour response MUST contain exactly two lines:\n4056\tLine 1: Summary: <single {src_lang} sentence summary>\n4057\tLine 2: Translation: <translation of the summary in {tgt_lang}>\n4058\tDo not add any other text, explanation, or formatting. Both lines are required.\n4059\tIf the summary is not in {tgt_lang}, translate it to {tgt_lang}.\n4060\t\n4061\tFigure 18: Prompt for Gemma4-12B few-shot (FS) setting in the summarization→translation direction.\n4062\tGemma4-12B ZS Translation→Summarization\n4063\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer.\n4064\tYou will hear {src_lang} audio.\n4065\tYour response MUST contain exactly two lines:\n4066\tLine 1: Translation: <complete {tgt_lang} translation of everything said in the audio>\n4067\tLine 2: Summary: <single sentence in {tgt_lang} summarising the main point>\n4068\tDo not add any other text, explanation, or formatting.\n4069\tBoth lines are required.\n4070\t\n4071\tFigure 19: Prompt for Gemma4-12B zero-shot (ZS) setting in the translation→summarization direction.\n4072\tGemma4-12B ZS Summarization→Translation\n4073\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer.\n4074\tFirst summarize the audio in one sentence, then translate it.\n4075\tListen to the following {src_lang} audio and produce:\n4076\t\"Summary: <one-sentence {src_lang} summary>\n4077\tTranslation: <{tgt_lang} translation of the one-sentence summary>\n4078\tOutput ONLY these two lines, with no additional text or formatting.\n4079\t\n4080\tFigure 20: Prompt for Gemma4-12B zero-shot (ZS) setting in the summarization→translation direction.\n4081\t\n4082\t\fQwen3-Omni FS Translation→Summarization\n4083\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer. You are given 5 examples of {src_lang} audio and\n4084\ttheir corresponding summaries in {tgt_lang}.\n4085\tYou will hear {src_lang} audio. You must translate the entire audio into {tgt_lang}, then summarize\n4086\tit in a single sentence {tgt_lang} summary.\n4087\tYour response MUST contain exactly two lines:\n4088\tLine 1: Translate: <{tgt_lang} translation of the {src_lang} article>\n4089\tLine 2: Translation: <single {tgt_lang} sentence summary>\n4090\tThe examples below show only the Summary line; you must still produce both lines.\n4091\tDo not add any other text, explanation, or formatting.\n4092\t\n4093\tFigure 21: Prompt for Qwen3-Omni few-shot (FS) setting in the translation→summarization direction.\n4094\tQwen3-Omni FS Summarization→Translation\n4095\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer. You are given 5 examples of {src_lang} audio and\n4096\ttheir corresponding summaries in {tgt_lang}.\n4097\tYou will hear {src_lang} audio. You must summarize the audio into a single sentence in {src_lang} and\n4098\ttranslate the summary to {tgt_lang}.\n4099\tYour response MUST contain exactly two lines:\n4100\tLine 1: Summary: <single {src_lang} sentence summary>\n4101\tLine 2: Translation: <translation of the summary in {tgt_lang}>\n4102\tThe examples below show only the Summary line; you must still produce both lines.\n4103\tDo not add any other text, explanation, or formatting.\n4104\t\n4105\tFigure 22: Prompt for Gemma4-12B few-shot (FS) setting in the summarization→translation direction.\n4106\tQwen3-Omni ZS Translation→Summarization\n4107\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer.\n4108\tYou will hear {src_lang} audio.\n4109\tYour response MUST contain exactly two lines:\n4110\tLine 1: Translation: <complete {tgt_lang} translation of everything said in the audio>\n4111\tLine 2: Summary: <single sentence in {tgt_lang} summarising the main point>\n4112\tDo not add any other text, explanation, or formatting.\n4113\tBoth lines must be present, if not, the output will be considered invalid.\n4114\t\n4115\tFigure 23: Prompt for Qwen3-Omni zero-shot (ZS) setting in the translation→summarization direction.\n4116\tQwen3-Omni ZS Summarization→Translation\n4117\tYou are a professional translator and summarizer. First summarize the audio in one sentence, then\n4118\ttranslate it.\n4119\tListen to the following {src_lang} audio and produce:\n4120\tSummary: <one-sentence {src_lang} summary>\n4121\tTranslation: <{tgt_lang} translation of the one-sentence summary>\n4122\tOutput ONLY these two lines, with no additional text or formatting.\n4123\t\n4124\tFigure 24: Prompt for Qwen3-Omni zero-shot (ZS) setting in the summarization→translation direction.\n4125\t\n4126\t\fCoT\n4127\tYou are a skilled analyst tasked with producing a concise and accurate summary in the TARGET LANGUAGE\n4128\tfrom the given audio in SOURCE LANGUAGE.\n4129\tThe summary must preserve essential meaning, maintain logical coherence, and avoid introducing any\n4130\tinformation not supported by the audio.\n4131\tSOURCE LANGUAGE : {src_lang}\n4132\tTARGET LANGUAGE: {tgt_lang}\n4133\tReasoning Guidance (Internal Processing Only):\n4134\tBefore writing the summary, internally process the audio in two stages. Do NOT output any intermediate\n4135\tresults, lists, or structured fields.\n4136\t-----------STAGE 1 — SEMANTIC EXTRACTION (5W1H-BASED UNDERSTANDING)\n4137\tInternally identify the core informational components of the audio using the following perspective:\n4138\t- WHO: the key entities involved (people, organizations, agents)\n4139\t- WHAT: the main event or action that defines the audio\n4140\t- WHEN: relevant temporal information (if present)\n4141\t- WHERE: relevant spatial or situational context (if present)\n4142\t- WHY: motivations, causes, or triggers (if stated)\n4143\t- HOW: mechanisms, processes, or manner of action (if stated)\n4144\t-----------STAGE 2 — REASONING AND INFORMATION INTEGRATION\n4145\tUsing the extracted meaning representation:\n4146\t1. Determine which elements are central to the overall meaning of the audio (salience reasoning).\n4147\t2. Identify how the key elements are connected (causal, temporal, or logical relations).\n4148\t3. Remove redundant, repetitive, or non-essential details while preserving completeness.\n4149\t4. Ensure that the remaining information forms a coherent and unified interpretation of the audio.\n4150\t5. If the audio is not in the TARGET LANGUAGE, convert the meaning representation into the\n4151\tTARGET LANGUAGE at a semantic level (not lexical translation).\n4152\t-----------OUTPUT GENERATION\n4153\tWrite a fluent and concise one sentence summary in the TARGET LANGUAGE that:\n4154\t- reflects the integrated understanding from both stages\n4155\t- maintains logical flow and coherence\n4156\t- presents information in a natural, human-like summary form\n4157\t- avoids unnecessary detail while preserving essential meaning\n4158\t-----------OUTPUT CONSTRAINT (STRICT)\n4159\tOutput ONLY the final summary in the TARGET LANGUAGE.\n4160\tDo NOT output:\n4161\t- 5W1H components\n4162\t- reasoning steps\n4163\t- intermediate representations\n4164\t- bullet points or lists\n4165\t- explanations or metadata\n4166\tSUMMARY:\n4167\t\n4168\tFigure 25: CoT Prompts used for Gemini3.1-Pro, Gemma4-12B, and Qwen3-Omni.\n4169\t\n4170\t\fHuman Evaluation Survey Example Question\n4171\tListen to the source audio and read the source article, then rate the 5 system summaries.\n4172\tAudio Article\n4173\t[00:00 – 01:22, waveform playback of source audio]\n4174\tText Article\n4175\t\"Пiсля вiйни за свiй гендер, яка тривала все моє життя, я вирiшив прийняти себе таким,\n4176\tяким я є – всерединi i зовнi – йдеться на сторiнцi поп-зiрки в Instagram. \"Я дуже нервував\n4177\tперед тим, як анонсувати це, оскiльки придiляю забагато значення тому,. . .\n4178\tOverall audio article understanding\n4179\tHow well did you understand the source audio article?\n4180\t◦ 1 – Did not understand\n4181\t◦ 2 – Limited understanding\n4182\t◦ 3 – Partial understanding\n4183\t◦ 4 – Good understanding\n4184\t• 5 – Excellent understanding\n4185\t\n4186\t(selected)\n4187\t\n4188\tFor each summary, provide a 1–5 overall quality rating: accurate, engaging, and informative.\n4189\tSummary 1\n4190\tBritish pop star Sam Smith has publicly announced their non-binary gender identity, admitting that they feel neither\n4191\tmale nor female. Overall quality: accurate, engaging, and informative\n4192\t◦ 1 – Very Poor\n4193\t◦ 2 – Poor\n4194\t◦ 3 – Fair\n4195\t◦ 4 – Good\n4196\t• 5 – Excellent\n4197\t\n4198\t(selected)\n4199\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "714b59ad-b3aa-4f8f-8fbc-b53183577fe2", "uuid": "a8cb2a45-607e-4f4e-8201-f5b2822c71a1", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T09:15:56.283Z", "tool_use_result": {"type": "text", "file": {"filePath": "/tmp/voxsumm.txt", "content": "0.637\n\n0.634\n\n(0.082)\n\n(0.046)\n\n(0.056)\n\n(0.061)\n\n(0.018)\n\n(0.021)\n\n(0.021)\n\n(0.020)\n\n(0.010)\n\n(0.049)\n\n(0.043)\n\n(0.034)\n\n0.686\n\n0.656\n\n0.658\n\n0.666\n\n0.631\n\n0.605\n\n0.643\n\n0.627\n\n0.668\n\n0.668\n\n0.667\n\n0.668\n\n(0.134)\n\n(0.106)\n\n(0.132)\n\n(0.124)\n\n(0.032)\n\n(0.040)\n\n(0.045)\n\n(0.039)\n\n(0.082)\n\n(0.059)\n\n(0.068)\n\n(0.070)\n\n0.728\n\n0.690\n\n0.685\n\n0.701\n\n0.601\n\n0.616\n\n0.621\n\n0.613\n\n0.670\n\n0.660\n\n0.650\n\n0.660\n\n(0.259)\n\n(0.199)\n\n(0.199)\n\n(0.219)\n\n(0.133)\n\n(0.138)\n\n(0.134)\n\n(0.135)\n\n(0.183)\n\n(0.162)\n\n(0.115)\n\n(0.153)\n\n0.733\n\n0.695\n\n0.695\n\n0.708\n\n0.595\n\n0.611\n\n0.610\n\n0.605\n\n0.664\n\n0.663\n\n0.647\n\n0.658\n\n(0.183)\n\n(0.149)